=> Explore Application Insights

    -> What is Application Insights?
        - Application Insights is an Application Performance Monitoring (APM) service
        - It is an extension of Azure Monitor
        - Used to monitor application performance, availability, and usage

    -> Purpose of Application Insights

        -> Proactive Monitoring
            - Understand application performance before issues occur
            - Detect failures and anomalies early

        -> Reactive Monitoring
            - Investigate incidents after failures occur
            - Analyze logs, traces, and telemetry

    -> Main Benefits
